  Description: The cleric who lays down the law. Every strike stuns the first enemy
    it touches, whoever hits an ally under his command is halted, and his truth silences
    everyone who stands in it.
  DescriptionEs: "El cl\xE9rigo que impone la ley. Cada golpe aturde al primer enemigo
    que toca, quien golpea a un aliado bajo su mando queda detenido, y su verdad
    silencia a todos los que la pisan."
